---
title: Last Word
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 31 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour equal parts @gin{0.75%fl_oz}, @green Chartreuse{0.75%fl_oz}, @maraschino liqueur{0.75%fl_oz} and @lime juice{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a @cocktail cherry{1}.

> A Prohibition-era drink from the Detroit Athletic Club.
